<%- include('partials/head', { title: '1Password Practice' }) %>

<div class="card">
  <h1>Practice creating &amp; managing a login</h1>
  <p>This is a sandbox for getting comfortable with 1Password's browser extension: saving a new
    login, generating and storing a strong password, setting up two-factor authentication with
    1Password's built-in authenticator, and saving a passkey.</p>
  <p><strong>Nothing here is a real account.</strong> Create as many dummy logins as you like and
    reset them whenever you want.</p>

  <% if (user) { %>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/account">Go to your account</a>
  <% } else { %>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/signup">Create a dummy account</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/login">Log in</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/login/passkey">Log in with a passkey</a>
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <h2>What to try</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Sign up — let 1Password suggest and save a strong password.</li>
    <li>Turn on 2FA — scan the QR code with 1Password and save the one-time code field.</li>
    <li>Log out, then log back in using the code 1Password generates for you.</li>
    <li>Save a passkey and use it to log in without a password at all.</li>
    <li>Change your password and confirm 1Password offers to update the saved login.</li>
  </ol>
</div>

<%- include('partials/foot') %>
